    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know it's \"natural\" or whatever but it doesn't make it any less exhausting. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it's like he took my entire soul with him when he left. i'm just a shell. i don't see a way to \"navigate\" this... there's just nothing to navigate to. i'm just stuck in this void.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
